<title>USA: TCF Financial Corp Q3 net drops.</title>
<headline>TCF Financial Corp Q3 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.15		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net			  5,296		   24,413</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Third quarter earnings include a $21.7 million or $0.62 a share after-tax charge by the Federal Deposit Insurance Corp to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.  </p>
<p>			 NINE MONTHS</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.64		    $0.97</p>
<p> Net			 58,234		   35,205</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total assets at September 30, 1996 were $7.11 billion versus $7.24 billion last year.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
